flowchart TD
    Handoff[Existing lawful fuel handoff / safe crew exit] --> Report[Existing ordinary _report command]
    Report --> Current[Read same person origin and assigned destination]
    Current --> Match{At a current actual heavy-owner bay?}
    Match -->|No| Normal[Existing walk_path to destination]
    Match -->|Yes| Door[Resolve that owner site_door]
    Door --> Outward[Existing current-footprint walk_path door to destination]
    Outward --> Clear{Nonempty onward route?}
    Clear -->|Yes| Compose[Bay centre then own door then final destination]
    Clear -->|No| Block[Empty path: Route blocked / infinite deadline]
    Normal --> Move[Existing _move Reporting]
    Compose --> Move
    Move --> Arrival[Existing physical phase completion; presence only on arrival]
    Ghost[Unused legacy owner in empty field] --> Ignore[No special exit permission]
    Ignore --> Normal
